   "description": "Fibo 2.0 Generate is Bria's text-to-image model for campaign visuals, product and lifestyle scenes, and prompts that involve multiple subjects or spatial relationships. Bria describes its strengths as reasoning- and knowledge-heavy prompts and states that it is trained on licensed data.\n\nThe endpoint accepts a free-form prompt, which is expanded into a structured prompt, or a VGL document used directly. The structured prompt is returned with the generated image and can be reused in a later request.\n\nOutput is approximately one megapixel, with 21 aspect ratios from panoramic 5:1 to vertical 1:5. A seed controls reproducibility, and sync mode returns the image directly in the response. An optional image_url provides a visual reference for a prompt, or a close variation when used alone. It cannot be combined with vgl or style.\n\nFor changes to an existing image, use Fibo 2.0 Edit.",
